% Daml intro, parties: proposals, authorization and delegation
%
% The Logical English (for LPS) twin of a Daml project, written by the Daml translator
% from its source: each template a fluent keyed by the contract id, each create and choice an action,
% who may do what integrity constraints. The source is kept in sources/ (File > Show the Original in the
% Logical English editor, View > The original this was converted from in the LPS2 IDE).
% The ids of the contracts a command creates are places of its action: the ledger assigns them, a scenario names them.
% Who may do what, as one permission per command: the legal view
% (Misc > Legal View of This LPS Program in the Logical English editor, View > Legal view in the LPS2 IDE).

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 4.

the actions are:
    *a party* creates the simple iou *a simple iou* with issuer *an issuer*, owner *an owner*, cash currency *a cash currency* and cash amount *a cash amount*; known as create_simple_iou.
    *a party* creates the iou *an iou* with issuer *an issuer*, owner *an owner*, cash currency *a cash currency* and cash amount *a cash amount*; known as create_iou.
    *a party* creates the iou proposal *an iou proposal* with iou issuer *an iou issuer*, iou owner *an iou owner*, iou cash currency *an iou cash currency* and iou cash amount *an iou cash amount*; known as create_iou_proposal.
    *a party* creates the iou transfer proposal *an iou transfer proposal* with iou issuer *an iou issuer*, iou owner *an iou owner*, iou cash currency *an iou cash currency*, iou cash amount *an iou cash amount* and new owner *a new owner*; known as create_iou_transfer_proposal.
    *a party* creates the iou sender *an iou sender* with sender *a sender* and receiver *a receiver*; known as create_iou_sender.
    *a party* creates the non transitive *a non transitive* with party a *a party a* and party b *a party b*; known as create_non_transitive.
    *a party* archives the simple iou *a simple iou*; known as archive_simple_iou.
    *a party* archives the iou *an iou*; known as archive_iou.
    *a party* archives the iou proposal *an iou proposal*; known as archive_iou_proposal.
    *a party* archives the iou transfer proposal *an iou transfer proposal*; known as archive_iou_transfer_proposal.
    *a party* archives the iou sender *an iou sender*; known as archive_iou_sender.
    *a party* archives the non transitive *a non transitive*; known as archive_non_transitive.
    *a party* exercises transfer on the iou *an iou* with new owner *a new owner* creating *a second iou*; known as transfer.
    *a party* exercises propose transfer on the iou *an iou* with new owner *a new owner* creating *an iou transfer proposal*; known as propose_transfer.
    *a party* exercises mutual transfer on the iou *an iou* with new owner *a new owner* creating *a second iou*; known as mutual_transfer.
    *a party* exercises accept on the iou proposal *an iou proposal* creating *an iou*; known as iou_proposal_accept.
    *a party* exercises cancel on the iou transfer proposal *an iou transfer proposal* creating *an iou*; known as iou_transfer_proposal_cancel.
    *a party* exercises reject on the iou transfer proposal *an iou transfer proposal* creating *an iou*; known as iou_transfer_proposal_reject.
    *a party* exercises accept on the iou transfer proposal *an iou transfer proposal* creating *an iou*; known as iou_transfer_proposal_accept.
    *a party* exercises send iou on the iou sender *an iou sender* with iou cid *an iou cid* creating *an iou*; known as send_iou.
    *a party* exercises try a on the non transitive *a non transitive* creating *a second non transitive*; known as try_a.
    *a party* exercises try b on the non transitive *a non transitive* with other *an other* creating *a second non transitive*; known as try_b.

the fluents are:
    *a simple iou* is a simple iou with issuer *an issuer*, owner *an owner*, cash currency *a cash currency* and cash amount *a cash amount*; known as simple_iou.
    *an iou* is an iou with issuer *an issuer*, owner *an owner*, cash currency *a cash currency* and cash amount *a cash amount*; known as iou.
    *an iou proposal* is an iou proposal with iou issuer *an iou issuer*, iou owner *an iou owner*, iou cash currency *an iou cash currency* and iou cash amount *an iou cash amount*; known as iou_proposal.
    *an iou transfer proposal* is an iou transfer proposal with iou issuer *an iou issuer*, iou owner *an iou owner*, iou cash currency *an iou cash currency*, iou cash amount *an iou cash amount* and new owner *a new owner*; known as iou_transfer_proposal.
    *an iou sender* is an iou sender with sender *a sender* and receiver *a receiver*; known as iou_sender.
    *a non transitive* is a non transitive with party a *a party a* and party b *a party b*; known as non_transitive.

